</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Real Quantization Results</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section we provide a complete set of evaluation results for Llama-3 (Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct, Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct, Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct, Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct) and Qwen-3 (Qwen-3-8B, Qwen-3-14B, Qwen-3-32B) model families. We turn off thinking mode for Qwen as it turned out that long reasoning chains-of-thought turned out to be detrimental for performance on GSM8k and MMLU-CoT. The scores were produced using QuTLASS vLLM integration.</p>
</div>
